@startuml
autonumber
actor "ATCC / Backoffice" as Actor
participant ":System" as System

activate Actor
Actor -> System: requests to update a specific flight route
activate System
System --> Actor: displays current route data (including version)
deactivate System

Actor -> System: submits updated data (distance, requirements, version)
activate System
System --> Actor: confirms update and returns new route state (200 OK)
deactivate System
deactivate Actor
@enduml